    "Copied to your clipboard.": "Yi kopiwile eka khilipibodo ya wena.",
    "Select the text above and copy it.": "Hlawula marito lama nga laha henhla u ma kopa.",
    "Backup downloaded. Keep the file somewhere safe.": "Nhlayiso wu dawunilodiwile. Veka fayili endhawini leyi hlayisekeke.",
