    "Since 1 September 2024 your fund has up to three pots. See what a savings pot withdrawal costs.": "Ku sukela hi ti 1 Ndzati 2024 nkwama wa wena wu na timbita leti fikaka eka tinharhu. Vona leswaku ku humesa mali eka mbita yo hlayisa swi durha mali muni.",
