    "One third of new contributions. One withdrawal a tax year, at least R2 000, taxed at your marginal rate.": "Xiphemu xin'we eka swinharhu xa minhlohlotelo leyintshwa. Ku humesa kan'we hi lembe ra xibalo, bonyane i R2 000, yi baleriwa hi mpimo wa wena wa xibalo xa le henhla.",
    "Two thirds of new contributions. Locked until retirement, when it buys an annuity.": "Swiphemu swimbirhi eka swinharhu swa minhlohlotelo leyintshwa. Yi lotleriwile ku fikela eku tshikeni ka ntirho, laha yi xavaka mali leyi hakeriwaka hi lembe.",
